<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[50vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367749/eurocert/r7.png.png" alt="Benefits of Becoming our Associate" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16] via-[#030a16]/80 to-[#030a16]/60"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-6 flex-wrap"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 heading-font text-[9px] font-bold text-eurogold-400 uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 border border-eurogold-400/20"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400"></span>Careers</span><span class="text-white/30 text-xs">Posted On November 4, 2016</span><span class="text-white/30 text-xs">By admin</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Benefits of Becoming our <span class="text-eurogold-400">Associate</span></h1><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-white/80 text-sm heading-font mt-6"><span class="text-white/90">2016</span><span>/</span><span class="text-white/90">November</span><span>/</span><span class="text-white/70">Benefits of becoming our Associate</span></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">About Us</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Why Partner with <span class="text-euro-600">Eurocert?</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">We, Eurocert Inspection Services Pvt. Limited have been operational in India since 2009 and are a 100% subsidiary company of EUROCERT S.A – A Pan-European Certification body operating from Athens. Eurocert has been accredited for more than 30 standards by various accreditation boards including UKAS, ACCREDIA, ESYD and SAAS.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">As a part of our expansion strategy in the <strong class="text-slate-900">Indian Sub-Continent</strong>, we are looking to expand into various regions of India and are looking to closely associate with quality assurance professionals through a win-win relationship.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 border border-euro-100"><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Who Can Apply?</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">If you are <strong class="text-euro-600">aged above 30 years</strong> with at least <strong class="text-euro-600">4 years of experience</strong> in any of the below fields, you can apply to us for becoming our associate:</p></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white text-euro-600 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-leaf text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Environmental Management</h4><p class="text-euro-600 text-xs font-medium">ISO 14001</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white text-euro-600 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Information Security Management</h4><p class="text-euro-600 text-xs font-medium">ISO 27001, ISO 20000</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white text-euro-600 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-code text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Software Quality Assurance</h4><p class="text-euro-600 text-xs font-medium">SQUARE</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white text-euro-600 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-utensils text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Food Safety Assurance</h4><p class="text-euro-600 text-xs font-medium">ISO 22000, FSMS, IFS, HACCP, GLOBALGAP</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white text-euro-600 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-hard-hat text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Occupational Health and Safety</h4><p class="text-euro-600 text-xs font-medium">OHSAS</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white text-euro-600 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-bolt text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Energy Management</h4><p class="text-euro-600 text-xs font-medium">ISO 50001</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-list text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">What We Expect</h3></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="heading-font text-[9px] font-bold text-eurogold-400">1</span></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Business associate would maintain NO conflict of interest and would be approved as an Auditor after training</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="heading-font text-[9px] font-bold text-eurogold-400">2</span></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Business associates are expected to hold training events on a regular basis in their territory</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="heading-font text-[9px] font-bold text-eurogold-400">3</span></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Business associates are expected to maintain relationship with the leads/consultants/professionals of the industry in their territory</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="heading-font text-[9px] font-bold text-eurogold-400">4</span></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Provide database for marketing effort to the back office</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-[#030a16] text-sm"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">What We Ensure</h3></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Regular training on Eurocert Services and procedure for certification</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">A portfolio for training events</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Advertising / mail campaign support for local area</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">A regular flow of share out of our profits</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Advantages</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of Becoming a <span class="text-euro-600">Eurocert Associate</span></h2></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-euro-600/10 bg-euro-50/30 text-center hover:border-euro-600/30 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"><i class="fas fa-user-check text-white text-base"></i></div><p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">Be approved as an Auditor for at least one system</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-euro-600/10 bg-euro-50/30 text-center hover:border-euro-600/30 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"><i class="fas fa-chart-line text-white text-base"></i></div><p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">You have the opportunity to enhance your income</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-euro-600/10 bg-euro-50/30 text-center hover:border-euro-600/30 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-white text-base"></i></div><p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">You will be promoting trainings</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-euro-600/10 bg-euro-50/30 text-center hover:border-euro-600/30 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"><i class="fas fa-graduation-cap text-white text-base"></i></div><p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">Continuous professional development</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-euro-600/10 bg-euro-50/30 text-center hover:border-euro-600/30 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"><i class="fas fa-headset text-white text-base"></i></div><p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">Back office support for lead generation</p></div></div><div class="mt-10 text-center"><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-4">Once we have information about you we shall like to contact you. Thanks for your interest!</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white bg-euro-600 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-euro-700 transition-all shadow-lg" href="/contact">Get In Touch <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-slate-100"><span class="text-slate-400 text-xs heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Category:</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-euro-50 text-euro-600 text-xs heading-font font-medium">Careers</span></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Related Posts</h3><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-10"><a class="rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group block overflow-hidden" href="/post/become-associate"><div class="h-32 overflow-hidden"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367746/eurocert/r6.png.png" alt="Become our Associate" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"/></div><div class="p-4"><p class="text-white/25 text-[10px] mb-1.5">November 15, 2016</p><p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">Become our Associate</p></div></a><a class="rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group block overflow-hidden" href="/post/sa-8000-certification"><div class="h-32 overflow-hidden"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1783576359/740846584_1759795811682176_4180866889850030433_n.webp_i3rvbl.webp" alt="SA 8000 Certification" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"/></div><div class="p-4"><p class="text-white/25 text-[10px] mb-1.5">February 8, 2017</p><p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">SA 8000 Certification</p></div></a><a class="rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group block overflow-hidden" href="/post/slcp-certification"><div class="h-32 overflow-hidden"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367718/eurocert/r1.png.png" alt="SLCP Certification | SLCP | Eurocert Asia" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"/></div><div class="p-4"><p class="text-white/25 text-[10px] mb-1.5">August 2, 2023</p><p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">SLCP Certification | SLCP | Eurocert Asia</p></div></a></div><div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-end"><a class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white/40 hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors group text-right" href="/post/become-associate"><div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Next Post</span><span class="text-xs text-white/30">Become our Associate</span></div><i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-xs group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i></a></div></div></div></div></section>
